dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferred1" scale="6" id="Narr_coT5iZLge0yAXbOq8Ap2Kg">21.1</ix:nonFraction> million. The consideration included an initial payment of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tg6WwxG7QE6wFy6CDOOc3A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireBusinessesGross" scale="6" id="Narr_qMv8nO45_EmunzDMlk90WA">7.2</ix:nonFraction> million in cash, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tg6WwxG7QE6wFy6CDOOc3A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" scale="6" id="Narr_YO1h9KST1UuDvdJbfZed_Q">6.5</ix:nonFraction> million in stock, a holdback of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tg6WwxG7QE6wFy6CDOOc3A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredOther1" scale="6" id="Narr_GxCxW944QE-2Paj4bwZNkw">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million and a contingent earnout that had an initial fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2023_To_12_1_2023_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_tg6WwxG7QE6wFy6CDOOc3A" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredLiabilitiesIncurred" scale="6" id="Narr_Fg6JpVgfFUGevFOCurwWxw">7.2</ix:nonFraction> million. The Company&#8217;s contingent earnout liability balance was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_Z2ichYokx0i8vscUWaeIMw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_JtW6huOdrEGgs7BRipqT3w">14.0</ix:nonFraction> million at June 30, 2025 and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_ujOjKVKBxkmnAFyqACCAiw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_RHGqdyPjkUyjfRGq3m8REw">7.3</ix:nonFraction> million at June 30, 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Our contingent earnout liability related to the Scite acquisition is in the &#8220;Level 3&#8221; category for valuation purposes. As of June 30, 2026 and 2025, the contingent earnout liability fair value was estimated using the ending business to consumer annual recurring revenue figures as of May 30, 2025 and a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_5_30_2025_udVeTaBBJ0yW8Q_JOIa71w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiabilityMeasurementInput" scale="0" id="Narr_xAiSQ6-Lc0etfwthXv2sFQ">9</ix:nonFraction>% <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_zdOtiRl1b0mBnokG3QPO6A;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">discount</span></span> rate less payments made. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Company finalized the calculation of the earnout for former shareholders of Scite at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_JNz4xBQUo06PeyQ6EPwoqw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationLiability" scale="6" id="Narr_5RM9Ox2DSUyInktNSvoTOQ">15.4</ix:nonFraction> million and recorded the final adjustment as of June 30, 2025. The earnout is comprised of a mix of cash and stock, with <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_JNz4xBQUo06PeyQ6EPwoqw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationPercentageOfEarnoutPaidInCash" scale="-2" id="Narr_Hvt_mLWE40ujJJ-6hBk1Rg">62</ix:nonFraction>% of the earnout to be paid in cash and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_JNz4xBQUo06PeyQ6EPwoqw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:BusinessCombinationContingentConsiderationPercentageOfEarnoutPaidInStock" scale="-2" id="Narr_2QZ2z2J2qU2C1arbBB6hAg">38</ix:nonFraction>% in the Company&#8217;s common stock. The first of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_CGwiawrZEkOJT01T2rYUAw" contextRef="Duration_7_2_2025_To_7_2_2025_us-gaap_BusinessAcquisitionAxis_rsss_SciteIncMember_g7piUJMWZUe0EY_D0yyW4w" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="rsss:NumberOfQuarterlyInstallmentPayments" scale="0" id="Narr_uWAgH050aky3N3b96Vi_SA">eight</ix:nonFraction> quarterly installment payments was disbursed in August 2025, with subsequent payments scheduled to continue quarterly until the final payment in May 2027. After June 30, 2025, the Company records accreted interest expense on the unpaid earnout liability. Prior to June 30, 2025, the change in fair value (which includes an interest component) was based on the assistance of a valuation specialist, using a Monte Carlo simulation of discounted cash flows based on management's forecast.</p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">49</p></div></div>
