format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfExercisableOptions" scale="0" id="Tc_QZ-31QgtzUeaPJbNQqKTMg_6_7">216,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr style=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:21.99%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Total</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.57%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:22.89%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_lGfTMIk8U02KeD9zfct_bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions" scale="0" id="Tc_wc9MlWKQIkuejja_8r6UyQ_7_3">2,705,304</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.57%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:22.89%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.57%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:22.88%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_lGfTMIk8U02KeD9zfct_bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfExercisableOptions" scale="0" id="Tc_oLogrH0zxUqIq0inasPVbw_7_7">2,315,475</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 36pt;">Restricted Common Stock</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the year ended June 30, 2026, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_UrHUA1nFwk-982lybolPAA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_ieNTJpcluEWnJXFNBKv7MQ">205,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of time vested restricted stock to employees. These shares vest over a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VestOverThreeYearPeriodMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_6JeUv52s-kuTHxLh8sfbAg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_qtN5r0x9CUyZmlgTuEVF3w">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> period, with <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_64jgD7zz506SifgRQ-Anpw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">one third</span></span> vesting after <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_us-gaap_VestingAxis_rsss_TrancheOneMember_Ozi1eykELUSSA8M6qlvahg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_26naKyuyFEOk9NbXIpK-_A">one-year</ix:nonNumeric> and quarterly thereafter, and remain subject to forfeiture if vesting conditions are not met. The aggregate fair value of these stock awards was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VestOverThreeYearPeriodMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_6JeUv52s-kuTHxLh8sfbAg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_SBHs5FJ4PE2kPAOuOPTcdQ">524,950</ix:nonFraction> based on the market price of our common stock ranging from $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_SdwFrndktkeGwtFIapUpZw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:StockRepurchasedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_l1FcxCmvEkaL0tgg4sN0qg">2.36</ix:nonFraction> to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_UFctvqaw70GLh3UUr1TPfg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:StockRepurchasedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_cwPJ6hhEeEKAZZ1WmEWDDg">2.94</ix:nonFraction> per share on the date of grant, which will be amortized over the range of a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VestOverThreeYearPeriodMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_6JeUv52s-kuTHxLh8sfbAg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_U1wOQBmldUSABeRVKhaKXA">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> vesting period. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VestOverThreeYearPeriodMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_D1bZoyuG2EWR4VbPnQvtCg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_IRJiSGuZP02lI6jQ9tfgXg">No</ix:nonFraction> shares were granted with these vesting conditions during the year ended June 30, 2025.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">53</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_IvynlxcQeEeefsGTcyrX_A_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_IvynlxcQeEeefsGTcyrX_A_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the year ended June 30, 2025, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_fqpN35Dv00iqndP3T46MJA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_L9Jm1N1n3kOrtfrcGNaGOg">590,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted stock to employees with an aggregate fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_fqpN35Dv00iqndP3T46MJA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_FHHqzNKpckaTQfcK8dTOsg">1,309,240</ix:nonFraction>. The shares were granted, under the 2017 Plan, as restricted stock awards to key management in accordance with its long-term equity bonus program (the &#8220;LTEBP&#8221;). <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_rsss_LongTermEquityBonusProgramMember_q149anbNEU2kgw-JgtLiOg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_INFQwScM0EOqkm2W7_1VGg">No</ix:nonFraction> shares were granted under the LTEBP during the year ended June 30, 2026. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The LTEBP replaces the previous restricted stock compensation program for executives. It first became effective on August 19, 2022, and grants under the program span <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_UrHUA1nFwk-982lybolPAA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_GihlbeSpWEeO6N2bWYNXwQ">5 years</ix:nonNumeric> from the grant date. The LTEBP is designed to better serve stockholder interests by aligning key executive compensation with stockholder value. &#160;Awards under the LTEBP will vest as follows, upon the 30-day volume weighted average price (VWAP) of our common stock reaching the following targets:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:72pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:36pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">&#8226;</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodOneMember_FFFPezhaOESnT-Srv904HA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_C30OhQJ8AE-Hl_Ja4DWLyw">20</ix:nonFraction>% at a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodOneMember_FFFPezhaOESnT-Srv904HA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_GIcMxkZQxE2GfhrYDbM76w">3.00</ix:nonFraction> per share (vestings occurred on March 14, 2024 and December 9, 2024);</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"></span>&#8226;<span style="display:inline-block;width:32.5pt;"></span><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodTwoMember_AbZLG6CGfk2xooct8afbpg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_7S8RqbsP4U6IraZ4jcuRMQ">20</ix:nonFraction>% at a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodTwoMember_AbZLG6CGfk2xooct8afbpg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_DnfLTknoJ0itTnsnUVoBuA">3.75</ix:nonFraction> per share (vesting occurred on January 3, 2025);</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"></span>&#8226;<span style="display:inline-block;width:32.5pt;"></span><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodThreeMember_Vx9fza-mJEOki6v83BMhGg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_N3v9KQwsOE-hCXAI4FhZGg">20</ix:nonFraction>% at a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodThreeMember_Vx9fza-mJEOki6v83BMhGg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_yV6H6iUUVEuyRV3xVZnx2A">4.50</ix:nonFraction> per share;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"></span>&#8226;<span style="display:inline-block;width:32.5pt;"></span><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodFourMember_5H2P5icqvU6kmXz0Qg7F4Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_aSbyZrIv9UKjoWUacOXnVg">20</ix:nonFraction>% at a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodFourMember_5H2P5icqvU6kmXz0Qg7F4Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_akYmNQLpoEu8L3Xaw6eA7g">5.25</ix:nonFraction> per share; and</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:36pt;"></span>&#8226;<span style="display:inline-block;width:32.5pt;"></span><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodFiveMember_7qzdgs5WbkymjatB4X8ycA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_BmlrKvFFr0et8LfjR2VvQw">20</ix:nonFraction>% at a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodFiveMember_7qzdgs5WbkymjatB4X8ycA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_USVOELLajUCUIYuXtE31ng">6.00</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Upon a change of control, vesting will accelerate with respect to that portion of the award that would vest if the target 30-day VWAP was achieved at the level above the per share price in such change of control transaction. For example, if we granted an award of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodOneMember_FFFPezhaOESnT-Srv904HA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_IBnVLwdde0iqLw6vsDUnWA">100,000</ix:nonFraction> shares under the LTEBP, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodOneMember_FFFPezhaOESnT-Srv904HA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_XRdiDjf_k06GxtjjYc34Ww">20,000</ix:nonFraction> shares would vest upon our stock price achieving a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodOneMember_FFFPezhaOESnT-Srv904HA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_9-Kvk24ZskmpEiIXZwGRyw">3.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodTwoMember_AbZLG6CGfk2xooct8afbpg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_HrMlPcWLL026GBrzhb7O-A">20,000</ix:nonFraction> shares would vest upon our stock price achieving a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodTwoMember_AbZLG6CGfk2xooct8afbpg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_FoccInNWhUCnbEiM8oHpSg">3.75</ix:nonFraction> per share. If the per share price in a change of control transaction was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodSixMember_Gn-WiFBbE0KNdbE6L7r8Hw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_ZW9V9FhmXEeDNh34dB1AgQ">5.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, vesting would accelerate for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodSixMember_Gn-WiFBbE0KNdbE6L7r8Hw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_8Zju84pALUqlQoXJkqpXmA">40,000</ix:nonFraction> shares under the same award (i.e. the number of shares that would vest for our stock price achieving a 30-day VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_rsss_VolumeWeightedAveragePriceVwapOfCommonStockOver30DayPeriodFourMember_5H2P5icqvU6kmXz0Qg7F4Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:VolumeWeightedAverageStockPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_oGxSV5uMp0Kznsqqex6XIQ">5.25</ix:nonFraction> per share, pursuant to a tier round up provision in the Plan effective upon a change in control). As a condition to receiving awards under the LTEBP, recipients will be required to hold at least <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_A26hpODeBE-Yzjl8TVC2YQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_TTMuJ8akHEyNSbvl-jNDpg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:PercentageOfAllVestedSharesRecipientIsRequiredToHoldDuringEmploymentInOrderToReceiveAward" scale="-2" id="Narr_q9w8Nb1qw0uiIO2EJ7Lc5Q">75</ix:nonFraction>% of all vested shares during the term of their employment. Applicable target 30-day VWAPs must be achieved within <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_TTMuJ8akHEyNSbvl-jNDpg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_e_8bOyj90UCCITv4smyJbQ">5 years</ix:nonNumeric> following the grant of awards under the LTEBP, and all unvested awards under the LTEBP will be forfeited upon expiration of such <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_fA4Mll1MmEaS1PngWxmbiw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">5-year</span></span> period. Recipients will also forfeit unvested awards in the event their service with our company terminates for any reason.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">As the vesting of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_fqpN35Dv00iqndP3T46MJA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesRestrictedStockAwardGross" scale="0" id="Narr_gF00bUEb-EW-kcfCdlAxbw">590,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted common stock under the LTEBP is subject to certain market conditions, pursuant to current accounting guidelines, the Company determined the fair value, with the assistance of a valuation specialist, to be $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_fqpN35Dv00iqndP3T46MJA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_GDrAYWrMuEKuhRXkEhu9TA">1,309,240</ix:nonFraction>, computed using the Monte Carlo simulations on a binomial model with a derived service period ranging from <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_eZLFzenJjEObA8072grRCA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" id="Narr_OdCe1UpUr0meOoHlb0H_Tg">0.64</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_2eQBXwkPkEyGipTHtKNx9Q" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedTerm1" id="Narr_szvjpF8Wqk6PXg3DCN0gug">2.33</ix:nonNumeric> years. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The total restricted common stock expense related to amortization of both time vested restricted stock awards and LTEBP restricted stock awards were $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_us-gaap_SellingGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember_VHFFL6nynkS852jyovActg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_QIoAi5JCp06mTqntFJrIaA">598,142</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_us-gaap_IncomeStatementLocationAxis_us-gaap_SellingGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesMember_DXdzDGtXVEiVrkG_fs6p6Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="0" id="Narr_HkvDYSX3cEup8T4I2muviQ">1,518,104</ix:nonFraction> during the years ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, respectively, and is included in selling, general and administrative expenses in the accompanying consolidated statements of operations and comprehensive income. As of June 30, 2026, the amount of unrecognized compensation related to issuances of restricted common stock was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_ODvN536UMU2nlS9aM6jIZA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_b8JwUVMHHkyrZtTljLL98w">520,476</ix:nonFraction>, which will be recognized as an expense in future weighted average vesting periods of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_UrHUA1nFwk-982lybolPAA" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_cPLNqaEKQE-ymk1d1wwJHQ">1.06</ix:nonNumeric> years. When calculating basic net income per share, these shares are included in weighted average common shares outstanding from the time they vest. When calculating diluted net income per share, these shares are included in weighted average common shares outstanding as of their grant date, using the treasury method. From the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_lGfTMIk8U02KeD9zfct_bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_dniPngycIE-_--eaF5hYWA">33,513,551</ix:nonFraction> shares issued and outstanding on the consolidated balance sheet as of June 30, 2026, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_lGfTMIk8U02KeD9zfct_bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_k8YvWdBTKE6wFumXc8Uhkw">1,093,793</ix:nonFraction> shares are subject to vesting and are not considered outstanding for accounting purposes. From the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_WjgvnHt0q0K__9ck3rxJew" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_UUcFe7Km3EGOzyjEG0xJww">32,479,993</ix:nonFraction> shares issued and outstanding on the consolidated balance sheet as of June 30, 2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2025_WjgvnHt0q0K__9ck3rxJew" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_bdcDrQS2PkW8w97A4E6qqg">1,399,210</ix:nonFraction> shares are subject to vesting and are not considered outstanding for accounting purposes. </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">54</p></div></div>
