=""><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:68.46%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Non-vested, June&#160;30,&#160;2026</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.19%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_ODvN536UMU2nlS9aM6jIZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedNumber" scale="0" id="Tc_KNg6BVANJkyyM7M66Bz7bA_13_2">1,093,793</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.73%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:12.19%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_ODvN536UMU2nlS9aM6jIZA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Tc_WovDylAul0iUU-o0DtAF6Q_13_5">1.78</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 36pt;">Common Stock Repurchase and Retirement</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Effective as of March 19, 2024, the Compensation Committee of our board of directors authorized the repurchase, on the last day of each trading window during which the outstanding awards remain outstanding and otherwise in accordance with our insider trading policies, of an aggregate value not exceeding $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2024_KOLbDDUCkkav1ydMO5ymBw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_cx5jj2qFV0ecne1ir-n5bA">750,000</ix:nonFraction> (the &#8220;Repurchase Cap&#8221;), in addition to the prior remaining balance of outstanding common stock of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2024_KOLbDDUCkkav1ydMO5ymBw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="rsss:AmountOfOutstandingCommonStockFromEmployeesToSatisfyTaxObligationsNConnectionWithVestingOfStockIncentiveAwards" scale="0" id="Narr_mT4OaYV_ykGtoT3sgJu6Rw">330,774</ix:nonFraction> (at prices no greater than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2024_srt_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_rsss_PubliclyAnnouncedPlansOrProgramsMember__HpWLZIM1kuyNBJ0M23WDw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_Ih5JPBDQP0q9ZGP-F0p9kQ">4.00</ix:nonFraction> per share) (the &#8220;Repurchase Price Cap&#8221;)) from our employees to satisfy their tax obligations in connection with the vesting of stock incentive awards through the end of fiscal year 2025. Effective as of December 19, 2024, the Compensation Committee of our board of directors authorized an increase in the Repurchase Cap to an aggregate value not exceeding $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2024_ns8V3GaN4kCI6fEhbWAXhg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_CcGfiTHgZUClQA59QIecfA">1,500,000</ix:nonFraction> and the Repurchase Price Cap to a price no greater than $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2024_srt_ShareRepurchaseProgramAxis_rsss_PubliclyAnnouncedPlansOrProgramsMember_zg3Ubuwz-kG7LNM1s3oR2A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_vi3aY_zIdUuR_F4fZ8B59Q">5.50</ix:nonFraction> per share. Effective as of May 6, 2025, the Compensation Committee of our board of directors authorized the repurchase of shares of common stock in satisfaction of tax withholding obligations at any time during a trading window during which outstanding awards remain outstanding and otherwise in accordance with our insider trading policies. The actual number of shares repurchased will be determined by applicable employees in their discretion and will depend on their evaluation of market conditions and other factors. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the years ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company repurchased <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_K2ng-WyTIUyqKzTsqv2Z2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_amT1icic70Kw68F7IED-Og">17,800</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_di-FZ6GKZE-ANlWE4HUrvQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_bl5-X9wfvkq4S15r88HyuQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_Sb2eJnAE9U-pL0-0zR6LpQ">310,330</ix:nonFraction> shares of our common stock under the repurchase plan at a weighted average price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_TTMuJ8akHEyNSbvl-jNDpg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_VzIqFEuphUSxud-91zDWyQ">2.98</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_XS1Nl-PcAECa0eEt-LurOA" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_FKyOfCPQK0m44cvkPkH5TQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TreasuryStockAcquiredAverageCostPerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_EIaTsiOhmE6vBc056PgD4Q">3.01</ix:nonFraction> per share, respectively, for an aggregate amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2025_To_6_30_2026_TTMuJ8akHEyNSbvl-jNDpg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_s4bs1i0brkWmH37og1USmg">53,039</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_6_30_2025_FKyOfCPQK0m44cvkPkH5TQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" scale="0" id="Narr_yHC6cHvnQkO7R6h75yxzwA">934,577</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. As of June 30, 2026, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_dWw5jbCz-0q4_XMGyHpImQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_lGfTMIk8U02KeD9zfct_bg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchaseProgramRemainingAuthorizedRepurchaseAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_dk942v4a3EmfzuIhRu4ETw">109,277</ix:nonFraction> remained under the current authorization to repurchase our outstanding common stock from our employees.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">Shares repurchased are retired and deducted from common stock for par value and from additional paid in capital for the excess over par value.&#160;Direct costs incurred to acquire the shares are included in the total cost of the shares.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">55</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:41.75pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_ddf0498a_43cf_42bd_8e29_de68108403a9"></a><a id="Tc_NA1o7sWr3kS0hEK5L0xYEA_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_TMot4imX-0KVgjs1Jp9IXw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_h_2ddg4cL0-PMv5-ynFinw_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_b7bVYV36I0iaiXSKjJ1rEg_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_Lu8YphOyT0-Zl6uJG1Zo2w_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_PzQ-Pv2vCEeEdKJja81H4A_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_0Yyi85VNH0yng7c2SmR14Q_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_5ZGR9nhX2EyJugKRDo9uAQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_iWM3J_MaA02icColvThypg_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_6RCiAhLbtUWOVmkYsvZUIw_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_EOT5pA7B4km7dIKBhxSzhw_4_7"></a><a id="Tc_cG1kkKxjjk-9eIAYDwHnww_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_zM115QjOj0ySWXgMsQLcXQ_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_2u4EBNK0hEyT2rkOFnLEbw_5_7"></a><a id="Tc_EeFR0fwy2UaaGWgp7-Himw_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_HvYKpU4950e2e8LwKJoI-w_6_4"></a><a id="Tc_LWenov-4rUWbBvlo9ssd7A_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_fKUag6SwO0anC5KPm3mafg_7_4"></a><a id="Tc_rCCOFyp7wEGA3VbKrHq4hQ_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_f9AZ7PMXfUWKm5mpBZ2fOg_8_4"></a><a id="Tc_h7jj51HNv0mgA5iRL355Sw_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_zUuXQH81lEKXulSzqwQnAA_9_4"></a><a id="Tc_6U7tmpMMcUqKX6siMIrmGA_9_7"></a><a id="Tc_qRoagQhqzUGiAUDspuRLuQ_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_v7iiB4BM-0yk2OT_vhKFDA_11_4"></a><a id="Tc_1igQhyEreU65-uuFk9Dmbg_11_7"></a><a id="Tc_qx8Y8NXCl0u6Pg8hxx_lvA_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_nklIWLirCEuitJECFfTeoA_12_4"></a><a id="Tc_8Ex2EA8i60S1iyFucykqGQ_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_3PfQfURw0kCqvB7rlK874w_13_4"></a><a id="Tc_R-0vp2ZSZ0OObpUf55ogrw_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_yIQDG0ADA0yAIAZ4mJk7-A_14_4"></a><a id="Tc_-vlM-0EMjESzNMeI8EBkWQ_15_0"></a><